res/uefi-ntfs.img is the 1 MiB signed UEFI:NTFS FAT image shipped by Rufus:

  https://github.com/pbatard/rufus/tree/master/res/uefi

It contains the UEFI:NTFS bootloader and NTFS EFI driver by Pete Batard
<pete@akeo.ie>, used only for `ezwin flash --layout uefi-ntfs`.

